---
description: Read ARCHITECTURE.md before structural changes to this skill marketplace.
alwaysApply: true
---

This repository is a Cursor and Claude skill marketplace, not a product app.

Before adding or renaming a skill, a validator, a manifest, or an example, read ARCHITECTURE.md. After a structural change, update ARCHITECTURE.md in the same turn.

Do not add a product UI here. Product UI belongs in the repo that installed these skills, behind lock-contracts, state-shell, and one-chunk.
